    rdfs:label "AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D" ;
    rdfs:comment "High-performance gaming CPU with 3D V-Cache technology. 8 cores, 16 threads, exceptional gaming performance. The 3D V-Cache provides a massive L3 cache of 96MB, giving this processor a significant advantage in gaming workloads compared to conventional designs." ;
