    rdfs:comment "Reliable AM5 motherboard with robust VRM design and comprehensive feature set. Supports DDR5 memory up to 6400 MHz, PCIe 5.0 for storage, and WiFi 6E connectivity. The TUF Gaming series is known for durability and military-grade component testing." ;
