    rdfs:comment "Fully modular power supply delivering 850 watts with 80 Plus Gold efficiency. Zero RPM fan mode keeps the PSU silent under low-to-moderate loads. The 10-year warranty reflects Corsair's confidence in the Japanese capacitors and robust design. Provides ample headroom for high-end GPU and CPU combinations." ;
