    rdfs:comment "Exceptional open-front airflow case with a unique angular design. Ships with two 180mm fans that move massive air volume at low noise levels. Supports GPUs up to 461mm in length and CPU coolers up to 188mm in height. The interior layout prioritises airflow over drive bays, making it ideal for high-performance builds that generate significant heat." ;
